  {
    "episode_id": 72380,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/2/72380.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 12,
    "turn_text": "Yeah very well said senator one thing I talk about on my podcast all the time is the fatherless crisis that we have going on in our country. I think it's having a devastating toll on our society. So many kids are growing up without a father in their life. And I think we're trying to solve all these other social issues. But unless we get to the core of this, I don't think anything is going to change. We got to tighten our nuclear family units here. And I think every kid gets a trophy philosophy has been a colossal failure. And I think it brings nothing but just terrible results. And I think on both sides of the fence here, I think that if you're a good dad, You're not out there breaking windows at the Capitol. If you're a good dad, you're not out there burning down a car or vandalizing a store. And the same thing, I think that at the core of this issue, Senator, we have a fatherless problem going on in our country here. And I think if we tighten it, we can solve all these problems. I agree with you 100%.",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
    "inferred_speaker_name": null,
    "inferred_speaker_role": null,
    "chosen_text_key": "transcript",
