        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "The 'every kid gets a trophy' philosophy has failed and produced negative outcomes.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Good fathers do not engage in violent acts like breaking windows at the Capitol.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Good fathers do not burn down cars or vandalize stores.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "The root cause of current societal problems lies in the lack of father figures.",
        "confidence": 0.87
