    "turn_text": "Yeah, good stuff, Senator. And as you mentioned there too, this all seems to be one side. Whenever I've had Secretary Pompeo on the show here, or I've had Eric Trump, I've gotten just destroyed on social media, and it never goes the other way. I never see that blowback when I have somebody from the other side on, and I try to bring people on for wall walks of life here, because I think one thing is that we're all connected as dads, no matter what side of the offense you're on, what religion or what race you are, as a dad, we all have this kind of understanding where each one of us is coming from. And obviously with the book out there now, have you seen a lot of pushback? Has it been taken down off any sites? I know you've said that you've been, whatever they call it, censored, which is a big thing going on. Have you faced that and had trouble with that with the book so far? Alright dads, my pillow has got so much more to offer than just the most comfortable pillow you'll ever own, but don't just take my word for it. Here's my wife to tell you her favorite product from my pillow. Honey, what is it?",
