    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/2/72380.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 34,
    "turn_text": "I would just say that there is no greater investment. There's no investment that is more worthwhile than in your child. And so just plan right now. You're going to have to say no to a whole bunch of stuff. Other things that you used to want to do that would take up your time. You have to say no to those. You're going to have to make your child a priority, but it is worth it. It is worth it 10 times, 100 times, 1,000 times over. So just embrace that, you know, I mean, a child will completely up end your life. It will completely change your life. And that's awesome. It is all for the better. And I can just say, as the years go by, it just gets better and better and richer and richer. So I wish that blessing for every person who wants to be a parent and for every dad.",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
    "inferred_speaker_name": null,
